<title>UK: CFD sets 500 mln Ffr fungible bond due Dec 2008.</title>
<headline>CFD sets 500 mln Ffr fungible bond due Dec 2008.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following fungible bond was announced by lead manager Societe Generale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE FRANCAISE DE DEVELOPPEMENT</p>
<p> AMT  **500 MLN FFR   COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    18.DEC.08</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  104.786   PAY DATE    14.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.30	REOFFER    103.836   SPREAD	+5 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	**FUNGIBLE WITH EXISTING 1.6 BLN FFR BOND</p>
<p> MOOSY/S&amp;P  =	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MGT	  0.10	UNDERWRIT  0.45	SELL CONC   0.75</p>
<p> NOTES	PLUS 1.414 PCT ACCRUED</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
